## Code Rules

- No force unwraps (`!`) in production code
- `async/await` only (no completion handlers)
- Protocol-based dependency injection (no `.shared` singletons)
- ViewModels must be `@MainActor`
- TDD: write tests BEFORE implementation (RED -> GREEN -> REFACTOR)
- Strict concurrency enabled (`SWIFT_STRICT_CONCURRENCY: complete`)
- Add DocC comments to all public APIs

